{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey</strong> is a roguelite deckbuilder set in a cyberpunk-fantasy world. Form alliances with Heroes from 3 rival Factions and venture into Sovereign\u2019s Island. Build Decks, forge Artifacts, unlock Talents, and master Skill Cards to conquer deadly foes and uncover the island\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9c4557191d74ebfa14c8725a00237089.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends tell of an AI-ruled island in the heart of the Sea of Data, where The Sovereign guards a treasure that can grant any wish. Three Factions hold the keys to Sovereign\u2019s Island, recruiting powerful Seekers to claim its riches. But only one can defeat The Sovereign and claim the ultimate prize.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7e2016a3bdb4293973848eb29586245c.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3478281ad46f9d1cb613bb7013e02c20.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3478281ad46f9d1cb613bb7013e02c20.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3478281ad46f9d1cb613bb7013e02c20.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rising power in the Sea of Data, the Van der Leck Family is young, passionate, and ambitious, yet possesses the intellect and detachment to see the big picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Race:</strong> Human, Furry, Mech</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Traits:</strong> Direct Damage, +Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Keywords:</strong> Triumph, Assault</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a855bc99357c673f0a62f863bee0bfe.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a855bc99357c673f0a62f863bee0bfe.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a855bc99357c673f0a62f863bee0bfe.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating behind codenames, House Galahad members are skilled hackers, relentless dreamers, and fearless trailblazers who fight in the name of freedom.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Race:</strong> Human, Cyborg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Traits:</strong> Phantom Cards, +Defense, +HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Keywords:</strong> Thwarted, Fortify</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/edec31a3758a8cfe8d9e1afa4604f6b2.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/edec31a3758a8cfe8d9e1afa4604f6b2.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/edec31a3758a8cfe8d9e1afa4604f6b2.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a lineage intertwined with dragons, members of Mahdia Alliance are wise philosophers and artists who uphold tradition and safeguard ancient virtues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Race:</strong> Human, Dragonborn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Traits:</strong> Stats Growth, +Speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Keywords:</strong> Initiative, Haste</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1e2093447b7205fa5dee590dac0f7475.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before embarking on the journey, players select an initial Hero with a unique Deck, Passive, and Ultimate Skill. After defeating an Area Boss and clearing the map, players can upgrade their Hero\u2019s Passive or Ultimate, then select an additional Supporting Hero to call on their abilities during battles. Special pairings between Heroes create a Faction-specific Hero Card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ea33848f8dc81f5feca761cd36797032.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ea33848f8dc81f5feca761cd36797032.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ea33848f8dc81f5feca761cd36797032.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3fb88ff15ec5ca1941a9e6b0c102b755.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey incorporates roguelite design through per-run progression, procedural variation, and meta-progression that persists across successful map completions. Each run features dynamically generated encounters, events, and rewards that shape the player\u2019s deck composition and influence their strategy. Adaptability is key, and each run offers a fresh adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/0376c40da593a0c0e198a3fb5332a497.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/0376c40da593a0c0e198a3fb5332a497.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/0376c40da593a0c0e198a3fb5332a497.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/c156bf3846e83f037ce079d743b7d907.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/c156bf3846e83f037ce079d743b7d907.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/c156bf3846e83f037ce079d743b7d907.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f8d75c4f89c006bae166ff715b27bcfe.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating Mobs, Elite Mobs, and Area Bosses rewards Gold, Talent Points, Treasure Chest Points, and Skill Cards. Gold can be used in Lil\u2019 Gecko\u2019s Shop to purchase Skill Cards and Artifacts, delete Skill Cards, and reforge Artifacts. Talent Points unlock Talent Trees to gain powerful boosts; Treasure Chest Points accumulate automatically and unlock chests full of rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/adb18635c2100909291631027e7f7bfd.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/adb18635c2100909291631027e7f7bfd.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/adb18635c2100909291631027e7f7bfd.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/a589158323b80c14e12692cc6f1720de.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/a589158323b80c14e12692cc6f1720de.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/a589158323b80c14e12692cc6f1720de.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3f98af3d90ebed1ba7d12d51701729ff.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are divided into three actionable zones: Attack (red), Defense (blue), and Speed (green). Skill Card effects trigger only when placed into their corresponding Zones, requiring careful strategy to optimize each play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/2e36c6f3d6aead11d174368e3c1c0afd.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/2e36c6f3d6aead11d174368e3c1c0afd.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/2e36c6f3d6aead11d174368e3c1c0afd.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/61f9c182539de93f1adf309b160a6dfe.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero has a unique Ultimate Skill with powerful, game-changing effects and personalized animations. The new Counter mechanic triggers cinematic head-to-head sequences during battle, enhancing player immersion. Professional voice acting brings Heroes and Bosses to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f52beaf81f5cde1c92791b0f6a123ff.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f52beaf81f5cde1c92791b0f6a123ff.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f52beaf81f5cde1c92791b0f6a123ff.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1bd01938d6a290b2b18c4e3fe2eccb16.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1bd01938d6a290b2b18c4e3fe2eccb16.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1bd01938d6a290b2b18c4e3fe2eccb16.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeker, if you\u2019ve made it this far\u2026 we hope you\u2019re impressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s your turn \u2013 try our demo. Feedback is welcome! See you on the battlefield!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1352890?t=1776744752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/e4591f9bd7da229660ed6fdede6e2502ade7926b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776744752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/121cd20c93c2cf71cc1d0c184d6c349a4ad103f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776744752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/121cd20c93c2cf71cc1d0c184d6c349a4ad103f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776744752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3975520,"description":""},{"appid":3975520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey</strong> is a roguelite deckbuilder set in a cyberpunk-fantasy world. Form alliances with Heroes from 3 rival Factions and venture into Sovereign\u2019s Island. Build Decks, forge Artifacts, unlock Talents, and master Skill Cards to conquer deadly foes and uncover the island\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/9c4557191d74ebfa14c8725a00237089.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends tell of an AI-ruled island in the heart of the Sea of Data, where The Sovereign guards a treasure that can grant any wish. Three Factions hold the keys to Sovereign\u2019s Island, recruiting powerful Seekers to claim its riches. But only one can defeat The Sovereign and claim the ultimate prize.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7e2016a3bdb4293973848eb29586245c.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3478281ad46f9d1cb613bb7013e02c20.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3478281ad46f9d1cb613bb7013e02c20.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3478281ad46f9d1cb613bb7013e02c20.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rising power in the Sea of Data, the Van der Leck Family is young, passionate, and ambitious, yet possesses the intellect and detachment to see the big picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Race:</strong> Human, Furry, Mech</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Traits:</strong> Direct Damage, +Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Keywords:</strong> Triumph, Assault</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a855bc99357c673f0a62f863bee0bfe.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a855bc99357c673f0a62f863bee0bfe.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7a855bc99357c673f0a62f863bee0bfe.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating behind codenames, House Galahad members are skilled hackers, relentless dreamers, and fearless trailblazers who fight in the name of freedom.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Race:</strong> Human, Cyborg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Traits:</strong> Phantom Cards, +Defense, +HP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Keywords:</strong> Thwarted, Fortify</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/edec31a3758a8cfe8d9e1afa4604f6b2.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/edec31a3758a8cfe8d9e1afa4604f6b2.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/edec31a3758a8cfe8d9e1afa4604f6b2.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a lineage intertwined with dragons, members of Mahdia Alliance are wise philosophers and artists who uphold tradition and safeguard ancient virtues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Race:</strong> Human, Dragonborn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Traits:</strong> Stats Growth, +Speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Keywords:</strong> Initiative, Haste</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1e2093447b7205fa5dee590dac0f7475.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before embarking on the journey, players select an initial Hero with a unique Deck, Passive, and Ultimate Skill. After defeating an Area Boss and clearing the map, players can upgrade their Hero\u2019s Passive or Ultimate, then select an additional Supporting Hero to call on their abilities during battles. Special pairings between Heroes create a Faction-specific Hero Card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ea33848f8dc81f5feca761cd36797032.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ea33848f8dc81f5feca761cd36797032.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/ea33848f8dc81f5feca761cd36797032.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3fb88ff15ec5ca1941a9e6b0c102b755.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey incorporates roguelite design through per-run progression, procedural variation, and meta-progression that persists across successful map completions. Each run features dynamically generated encounters, events, and rewards that shape the player\u2019s deck composition and influence their strategy. Adaptability is key, and each run offers a fresh adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/0376c40da593a0c0e198a3fb5332a497.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/0376c40da593a0c0e198a3fb5332a497.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/0376c40da593a0c0e198a3fb5332a497.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/c156bf3846e83f037ce079d743b7d907.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/c156bf3846e83f037ce079d743b7d907.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/c156bf3846e83f037ce079d743b7d907.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/f8d75c4f89c006bae166ff715b27bcfe.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating Mobs, Elite Mobs, and Area Bosses rewards Gold, Talent Points, Treasure Chest Points, and Skill Cards. Gold can be used in Lil\u2019 Gecko\u2019s Shop to purchase Skill Cards and Artifacts, delete Skill Cards, and reforge Artifacts. Talent Points unlock Talent Trees to gain powerful boosts; Treasure Chest Points accumulate automatically and unlock chests full of rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/adb18635c2100909291631027e7f7bfd.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/adb18635c2100909291631027e7f7bfd.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/adb18635c2100909291631027e7f7bfd.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/a589158323b80c14e12692cc6f1720de.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/a589158323b80c14e12692cc6f1720de.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/a589158323b80c14e12692cc6f1720de.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/3f98af3d90ebed1ba7d12d51701729ff.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are divided into three actionable zones: Attack (red), Defense (blue), and Speed (green). Skill Card effects trigger only when placed into their corresponding Zones, requiring careful strategy to optimize each play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/2e36c6f3d6aead11d174368e3c1c0afd.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/2e36c6f3d6aead11d174368e3c1c0afd.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/2e36c6f3d6aead11d174368e3c1c0afd.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/61f9c182539de93f1adf309b160a6dfe.avif?t=1776744752\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero has a unique Ultimate Skill with powerful, game-changing effects and personalized animations. The new Counter mechanic triggers cinematic head-to-head sequences during battle, enhancing player immersion. Professional voice acting brings Heroes and Bosses to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f52beaf81f5cde1c92791b0f6a123ff.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f52beaf81f5cde1c92791b0f6a123ff.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/7f52beaf81f5cde1c92791b0f6a123ff.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1bd01938d6a290b2b18c4e3fe2eccb16.poster.avif?t=1776744752\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1bd01938d6a290b2b18c4e3fe2eccb16.webm?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/extras/1bd01938d6a290b2b18c4e3fe2eccb16.mp4?t=1776744752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeker, if you\u2019ve made it this far\u2026 we hope you\u2019re impressed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s your turn \u2013 try our demo. Feedback is welcome! See you on the battlefield!</p>","developers":["Skvader Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1352890/a3b1e15bdb