020aca5f649526ea598aa18418ac22/ss_9e3500bc51020aca5f649526ea598aa18418ac22.600x338.jpg?t=1776744752"}],"short_description":"Seekers Alliance: Hero\u2019s Journey is a role-playing card game set in the Seekers Alliance universe. Venture into the mysterious Sovereign\u2019s Island with a diverse cast of Heroes, strengthening your decks through battles and encounters; confront powerful foes and uncover the Island\u2019s hidden secrets.","steam_appid":1352890,"support_info":{"email":"cyndy.hoy@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}